    L.Add('| `LingoFuse64.dll` / `liblingofuse.so` | Runtime library | Ships with the LingoFuse runtime |');
    L.Add('| `pascal_agent_service.exe` | Beacon server that routes tool calls | Built from `<v3>/src/pascal_agent_service.lpr` |');
    L.Add('| `mcp_api_tool.py` | MCP gateway that exposes tools to LLM clients | Ships with v3 at `<v3>/src/mcp_api_tool.py` |');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('### 1.2 Status of the C++ companion repository (`cppAgent`)');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('A dedicated **`cppAgent`** repository is planned to ship:');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('- `LingoFuse.h` (the C ABI header, matching `lingofuse_import.pas`)');
    L.Add('- A CMake package config (`find_package(LingoFuse)`)');
    L.Add('- A working sample C++ provider');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('**At the time of this writing the `cppAgent` repository has not been');
    L.Add('published yet.** Until it is, obtain the header from one of these');
    L.Add('sources:');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('| Source | Where |');
    L.Add('|--------|-------|');
    L.Add('| The LingoFuse runtime distribution | `LingoFuse.h` next to `LingoFuse64.dll` / `liblingofuse.so` |');
    L.Add('| The `LingoFuse-pasAgent-v3` repository | Translate the declarations in `<v3>/src/lingofuse_import.pas` to C++ |');
    L.Add('| Hand-written, minimal | Copy only the LF_* prototypes referenced by the generated `.cpp` (see section 3.1) |');
    L.Add('');
    L.Add('> **Placeholder note**: `<cppagent-repo-url>` is a literal placeholder.');
    L.Add('> Replace it with the actual clone URL of `cppAgent` once it becomes');
